-- **A hosted Gabbro program, built out of ONE file and a manifest -- and no hand-written C.**
--
-- The acceptance criterion of `B1` is a CHANGE and not a number: `gabbro build`, and the
-- binary runs. It answers `41`.
compiler cc -std=c11 -O0 -Wall -Wextra -Werror
out      target/bau-eintritt

unit eintritt program
    messung/proben/probe-eintritt.gab
